 ___[ Navigating Directories ]__________________________________|
|                                                               |
|  pwd          --- Shows current working directory             |
|  cd <folder>  --- Changes to specified folder                 |
|  cd ..        --- Moves up to parent folder                   |
|  cd /         --- Moves to root directory                     |
|  ls -la       --- Lists files and details in directory        |
|  tree         --- Displays graphical directory tree structure |
|  clear        --- Clears the terminal screen                  |
|_______________________________________________________________|
